From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Fu <github@antfu.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:50:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): show the pull request and diff stat in the
 workspace header

The workspace header showed only the title and project, so a workspace's
pull request and its uncommitted changes were only visible in the sidebar
row and the composer. The header now shows, next to the title, the change
request's number and state with its CI indicator, linking to the forge,
and the diff stat, which opens the Changes tab. Wide layouts only; the
compact header has no room beside the title.

Fork-Change: F-10
